+        # commanded rates and stays live; ReckonedPose shares LinkStatus's
+        # field names so either can be formatted the same way.
+        #
+        # It DRIFTS, by construction, and it is still the right number to
+        # show: drift is part of what the controller believes, and a stale
+        # reading that looks fresh is worse than a live one that is known to
+        # wander. Marked so the two cannot be confused.
+        dr = self._status.pose
